+Let `A` be the root of `H(U,η^-30)=0` with leading term `η^-20`.
+Formal Hensel recursion gives `A in k((η^10))` and
+`ord_η H_U(A,G)=-40`. Since the actual `H(F,G)` has order `-18`,
+
+```
+F=A+a η^22+terms of order >22,  a!=0.
